STATEMENT OF CHANGES (Apache-2.0 section 4b).  The ports are translations into
Rust and Python, not copies: they replace Fortran module state with explicit
arguments, replace LAPACK/UMFPACK with in-tree dense and sparse routines, return
error codes where the originals call STOP, and are re-entrant.  Several of them
deliberately DIFFER from the upstream behaviour where the upstream silently
overrides its own inputs; each such point is marked in the source and the
divergence is stated there rather than hidden.

Sub-components vendored inside GACODE and reflected in the ports: NCLASS
(W. A. Houlberg) and, historically, UMFPACK v2.2 — the latter is NOT translated
here (the sparse factorisation in this distribution is written from scratch).

